  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. Lake Formation: (New Service) AWS Lake Formation is a fully managed service that makes it easier for customers to build, secure and manage data lakes.  AWS Lake Formation simplifies and automates many of the complex manual steps usually required to create data lakes including collecting, cleaning and cataloging data and securely making that data available for analytics and machine learning.",
